{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0c6aae4650d2887a5d6b10ef319a86443132b36e6e57c68ba5bf4d6915a7dcb1", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の公演の準備を始めないとだが……。\nその前に、育と話をしないとな）", "zh": "（差不多该开始准备下次公演了……\n不过，得先告知育一声才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "9af602af84465e1ef59c3e349f36e924261d083d43a62df9b5df5c574678f0b6", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5e1d952f4d10c11f548817f7b3dc31e8d303f4498518a912c4cfdd4d37315e12", "ja": "おはよう、美奈子。\nこれからレッスンか？", "zh": "早安，美奈子。\n你接下来要去上训练课程吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "f69fc3ab4ae8996fbf9b559b20b223816769120bef9a1103970816b81be3e28d", "ja": "はい、育ちゃんたちと！　美咲さんから、控え室に\nいるって聞いたので、そろそろ迎えに行こうと思って♪", "zh": "对啊，要和小育她们一起去！美咲说她在准备室，\n我想也差不多该去找她了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4182ef48255da4b0e17348582de3b4e944a4fc3a927c63957aa6356330b4e369", "ja": "そうか、育は控え室にいるのか。", "zh": "这样啊，原来育在准备室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "68ff9787b760e170403150417ac99879dde09abee462bf003bf26ccf64bea667", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n育ちゃんがどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请问你找小育有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7ab8ed18898ab52de9ac63340c42a0413812a93dbdd62ec81b324fed03cccd3a", "ja": "うん、大事な話をしようと思ってたんだ。\nちょうど良かった。", "zh": "嗯，我有件重要的事情要找她。\n我们正好顺路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "374ad6fb38e1381b7cfaf9991abeea73f684a16f33b64df4f363c7f97af827ce", "ja": "大事な話……あ！　もしかして……！", "zh": "重要的事情……啊！该不会是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "a4b70bf2d9761191222009d0b04b0c7d9f33f29ee698ca62989d786d78a592ac", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　私にお手伝いできる\nことがあれば、何でもやります。手伝わせてください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！如果需要我帮忙，\n什么事都可以喔。请让我帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6868e48da1ecb0ea51437d4f8efb6b25a954c1c9fd4030eb9766774a3e0b4774", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。\nそれじゃ、控え室にいこうか。", "zh": "好，谢谢你。\n那么，我们一起去准备室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "83722abf8fcfb0e4b3b0c4017b0da7b049289f33174e960477e6fbe31c687fe3", "ja": "シャイドル、ひなたちゃんも、\nぜったいに見たほうがいいよ！　すっごく面白いから！", "zh": "小日，我觉得你一定要去看闪偶！\n真～的很好看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "40538dd941905756b22ac5ae97a45b06e38c113b87455a3fa22a9b5ada5c802b", "ja": "そうかい？　育ちゃんがそう言うなら、\nあたしも今度見てみるねぇ。", "zh": "是吗？既然小育这么推荐，\n那我下次也看看吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "3770114fcc0712079ec1fc403c752b449c580a9406e3ba4705add18dbe1a4646", "ja": "都会のテレビはチャンネルが多くて、\nあたし、迷ってしまうんだべさ。", "zh": "都市地区的电视有好多频道，\n我都不知道要看哪一台了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ef118907ab6dd47a67aa6bda5b8485402f4be890db1abfc372d69352d06c8eb9", "ja": "お、みんな盛り上がってるな。", "zh": "喔，你们聊得很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "29c9e4605dc1e791b582e294fc7ec8011424ed1956fbb270a88e727d88d8c261", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　今、育ちゃんから\n魔法少女アニメのレクチャーを受けていたんですっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n现在小育正在举办魔法少女动画的讲座喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "e7e8a859873c4a785d940e1f618ebcb6de4f74fa2b05cd09843a1fcb97607986", "ja": "シャイドル、なかなか奥が深いですねぇ……育ちゃんが\nリスペクトしてる作品ですし、間違いなさそうです！", "zh": "闪偶相当深奥呢……而且还是小育深深敬爱的作品，\n看了肯定不吃亏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "c57e25195b29789c23eff986dc04c8ab5737b462884ac9b98d08aef0748dd08e", "ja": "へ～、魔法少女のアニメか～。\nふふっ、私も小さいころよく見てたっけ。", "zh": "喔～魔法少女动画吗～\n呵呵，我小时候也很常看呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "03d39f04ddeb192b7377ccfa55839cbd76ec2b19aa6e08976710882935c813f0", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。\nわたし、アニメのお仕事もしてみたい！", "zh": "对了，{$P$}先生，\n我想要接和动画相关的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1019_p", "source_sha256": "945b79de0e34fdac9f879de8557f3bc32bd9ae9e100493bb8250102e88d20f6a", "ja": "育にアニメの仕事か……うん、いいかもな。\nそういう仕事も探しておくよ。", "zh": "让育接动画的工作……嗯，好像不错。\n我会去找找相关工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "dcd87b36e3a5cbc4a8a5f045c5b3b1b77e09170651ccae089b8c5856655d2e4e", "ja": "ほんと！？　やった～！\n約束だからね！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～！\n一言为定喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ff6d5515b2ddafb6e26b3eab501f12adfabb990b829db7e7ce14921cd86aa8d0", "ja": "ああ。それから……アニメじゃないんだけど、\n実は、育にやってもらいたい仕事があるんだ。", "zh": "好。另外……虽然不是动画相关的，\n但其实我有个新工作想请育接下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "50bb9101a543d759353b4771a01be185da03d0b3fd8690d61a47380c2c3adfa3", "ja": "わたしに、やってほしいお仕事？\nなになに！？", "zh": "想请我接下的工作？\n是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "cbfe7c88f0bb7943a7d4f0ee3e62d480943dbb3bc372049cc2bbf579c81a49ea", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nそれってもしかして……まさか！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你说的工作……莫非是！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a97a005fc466acaee9900865997ae48926b2b30a7f14ff68f27b89497ec1dc0f", "ja": "うん。次の公演で、\n育にセンターをお願いしたいと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，我想请育担任下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "ac7c562a3e91ea3dc7a5d24bad91529f8b988443503835c3789c44a905313506", "ja": "センター！？　わたしが……？", "zh": "Center！？我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "16e6608f2bab354ac225069f64d6b67d4e3fadcf83fa5093e1ac08236248f65e", "ja": "わぁ……センターって、公演の主役のかい？\n育ちゃん、すごいねぇ。", "zh": "哇……Center就是公演的主角吗？\n小育，你好厉害哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "cdd4706f9f7ab3b7d64e1962d631880ab6aadf46c6ee3ce99f12b0afa888d0f0", "ja": "なんだか、うれしくなってきたべさ。\nあたしも応援するよぉ。", "zh": "我也觉得好开心哪。\n我也会帮你加油喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "c1ead252aedf3b47b3e9cba4f8d3eb51c1b11a8762a7f49d11687f490fd2b4a7", "ja": "育ちゃん、いつも一生懸命がんばってるもんね！\n本当におめでとう！", "zh": "因为小育总是很努力嘛！\n真的很恭喜你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1029_p", "source_sha256": "46369e9adddc42c9b401cb05c93a2522a047e56ccc2a50c234b0c7e23ec599ad", "ja": "育、どうだ？　やってくれるか？", "zh": "育，怎么样？你愿意担任吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "2dbfb181a3b83b2691901d31de370721d130617806701583986c8a24724d1293", "ja": "{$P$}さん……うん！　わたし、\nいつでもセンターできるように、がんばってきたよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嗯！我一直很努力，\n随时都做好了当Center的准备喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1031_030iku", "source_sha256": "95624fd33838efcc2eb6aafade593dac53d01e08350156c3cdca8c93f184fca5", "ja": "だからわたし、やる！　センターやりたい！\n{$P$}さん、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "所以，我愿意！我想要当Center！\n{$P$}先生，请多多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "a75cec52f2affbef6d2596b652af62561a2b00053a170742e8da95cc1f647a3c", "ja": "ううっ！　か、感動ですぅ……！　ついに、ついに\n育ちゃんのセンター！　記録写真はおまかせください！", "zh": "呜呜！好、好感人……！小育、小育终于要担任\nCenter了！纪录照就交给亚利沙拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "c4e054d6f2a4cbd726b8078215fd643158d0ef7a15ca01efdcb0cab91632cf02", "ja": "うん、ありがとう亜利沙さん！\nわたし、本番までに、もっとがんばるね！", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你，亚利沙姊姊！\n我会比现在更加努力，直到正式演出的那天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1034_030iku", "source_sha256": "0eb9cb97ab32bad3f3af907fc85d81341641d4f9511dfb30258dbc908b1cc8da", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n次の公演、ぜったい成功させてみせるからね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我一定会让下次公演成功的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1035_p", "source_sha256": "34ac042d3cc655fa2be65a2a9849883dfbe9da127e4bf1baead365987383a84a", "ja": "（劇場最年少の育をセンターに指名するのは、\n少し迷ったが……やる気に満ちた、いい表情だ）", "zh": "（指名剧场最年幼的育担任Center，我本来\n还有点犹豫……但是她的表情很棒，充满了干劲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_031_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_031_1036_p", "source_sha256": "24017050f495fc215a43d1142323070d924258209f3b3165ab78f2e3531b1035", "ja": "（次の公演、育がステージに\nどんな魔法をかけるか、しっかり見届けよう！）", "zh": "（育会在下次公演的舞台上施展什么魔法呢？\n我要好好见证！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
